Defined at: [fixture_crate](https://docs.rs/fixture-crate/0.1.0/fixture_crate/index.html)::[TestUnion](https://docs.rs/fixture-crate/0.1.0/fixture_crate/union.TestUnion.html)
In crate: fixture-crate (0.1.0)

A union for testing union formatting.

Demonstrates a union with public and private fields, a generic parameter, and
an inherent method — the union counterpart to [TestStruct](https://docs.rs/fixture-crate/0.1.0/fixture_crate/struct.TestStruct.html).

union TestUnion<T: [Copy](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/marker/trait.Copy.html)> {
    pub as_int: u64,
    pub as_float: f64,
    private: T,
}

Fields:

  ◦ as_int: u64
    The integer view

  ◦ as_float: f64
    The floating-point view

  ◦ private: T
    A private generic field

Methods

